('admin.dashboard.intro', 'en-US', 'How these numbers are derived: projects counts all site projects; pages are split by whether the draft has an activated artifact (published) or not (draft / unpublished); "changed since publish" means the draft was edited after the last publish, so the live site still serves the older version. Everything is queried live, nothing is cached.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/dashboard.html: 统计口径说明（悬浮）', 1, now(), now()),
('admin.dashboard.intro', 'zh-CN', '统计口径：工程数取站点工程总数；页面数按草稿是否已激活产物区分「已发布」与「草稿 / 待发布」；「有更新未发布」指草稿在发布之后又改过、线上还是旧版本。全部为实时查询，不做缓存。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/dashboard.html: 统计口径说明（悬浮）', 1, now(), now()),
