('admin.product_categories.intro', 'en-US', 'Categories form a tree: build parent/child levels (the parent dropdown shows indentation) and order siblings by sort number. The slug is unique within the project; a category also carries an image and an SEO title / description. A product can be attached to several categories with one of them marked primary. A category referenced by a product cannot be deleted.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_categories.html: 领域说明（悬浮）', 1, now(), now()),
('admin.product_categories.intro', 'zh-CN', '分类是树：可以建父子层级（父级下拉里带缩进），同级按排序号排；工程内 slug 唯一，另带分类图与 SEO 标题 / 描述。商品可以挂多个分类并指定其中一个为主分类；被商品引用的分类不能删除。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/product_categories.html: 领域说明（悬浮）', 1, now(), now()),
